# Text Tracking

Any text displayed on the site must use the `tracking-tight` Tailwind class for letter-spacing consistency.

Apply `tracking-tight` to:
- Headings (h1, h2, h3, etc.)
- Paragraphs and body text
- Navigation links and buttons
- Labels, captions, and UI text

Add it to the element's `className` alongside existing classes (e.g. `className="text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight"`).
